<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p><code>shortcuts.js</code> opens the sheet on <kbd>?</kbd> unless the reader is typing in a field or another dialog is open, remembers what had focus, and returns focus there on close. A click on the backdrop or the Esc button closes it. The list itself is data in the partial: add a row there when a component gains a shortcut.</p></div>

